-- Tests of the agreements' root (l4/lib/agreements-root.l4): what it is asked, asserted. They sit
-- beside it and not in it (the client, 2026-10-22: "assertions about a file
-- should sit next to it, not be included in it"); the site shows them on
-- its page. `make l4` checks agreements-root through this file, which imports it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `agreements-root`

§ `בדיקות שורש ההסכמים`

-- What the site's page of this root lists (tools/roots.py): each
-- instrument it includes, its module and its name.
#EVAL map (GIVEN i YIELD CONCAT i's `module`, " | ", i's `title`) `the agreements' instruments`

-- It includes 13 instruments, each once.
#ASSERT count `the agreements' instruments` EQUALS 13
#ASSERT count (nub (map (GIVEN i YIELD i's `module`) `the agreements' instruments`)) EQUALS 13

-- The agreements' own precedence is this root's (the client, 2026-10-22:
-- "agreement precedence is the agreement root's responsibility"). An owner's
-- special-education teacher in 2025/26 as pedagogical coordinator: the
-- agreement of 19.3.2017 says 6%, the agreement of 19.10.2022 8%, and this
-- root rules 8%, by §23.
`a pedagogical coordinator in 2025/26` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2025
        `employer`                        IS `employed by another owning body`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS FALSE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10400
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 312
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 520
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`               IS `a recognised unofficial special-education school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS FALSE
        `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS 0
        `heads the junior division`        IS FALSE
        `the classes in each grade`        IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`      IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS FALSE
        `the post in the reform`          IS `a teacher in the tables`
        `the education`                   IS `with a first degree`
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS 0
        `the grade in the tables`         IS 0
        `the school's complexity level`   IS 0

GIVEN i IS A `pay item`, c IS A `teaching case`
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the agreements' ruling, in words` i c IS
    CONSIDER `the agreements' ruling on` i c
    WHEN JUST r THEN CONCAT TOSTRING (r's `the answer`), " | ", r's `governed by`'s `module`, " | ", r's `by the rule`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN "no agreement speaks"

#EVAL `the agreements' ruling, in words` `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` `a pedagogical coordinator in 2025/26`
#ASSERT (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `answer`) (`the agreements' claims on` `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` `a pedagogical coordinator in 2025/26`)
    EQUALS LIST 0.06, 0.08)
#ASSERT (`the agreements' ruling, in words` `the pedagogical coordinator's allowance rate` `a pedagogical coordinator in 2025/26`
    EQUALS CONCAT "0.08 | ", `the agreement of 19.10.2022`'s `module`, " | ", `§23: the provision in the employee's favour`)

-- The teachers' general agreements (MMS-518): of the agreement of
-- 21.2.2008 and the agreements that amend it, the latest in force in the
-- salary month speaks (§19, convention instruments.amendment-chain). A
-- State teacher whose 5% step was put off, in January 2010: the agreement
-- as signed says 5% of December 2007's 10,300, the deferral of 17.6.2009
-- 3%; this root rules the deferral's 309, and says why — §23 alone would
-- have taken the 515 the deferral took away.
`a State teacher put off, in January 2010` MEANS
    `teaching case` WITH
        `the salary month`                IS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010
        `employer`                        IS `employed by the State`
        `in post-primary education`       IS FALSE
        `in the upper division`           IS FALSE
        `represented by the secondary teachers' organisation` IS FALSE
        `in a population whose 5% step was put off` IS TRUE
        `combined salary today`           IS 10400
        `supplement 2001 today`           IS 312
        `supplement 2008 today`           IS 520
        `combined salary in December 2007` IS 10000
        `supplement 2001 in December 2007` IS 300
        `the kind of school`               IS `another school`
        `holds the pedagogical coordinator's role` IS FALSE
        `the interns the teacher mentors`  IS 0
        `heads the junior division`        IS FALSE
        `the classes in each grade`        IS 0
        `the roles the teacher holds`      IS 0
        `a further role approved by the district manager` IS FALSE
        `paid by the Ofek Hadash tables`  IS FALSE
        `the post in the reform`          IS `a teacher in the tables`
        `the education`                   IS `with a first degree`
        `the seniority the tables count`  IS 0
        `the grade in the tables`         IS 0
        `the school's complexity level`   IS 0

#EVAL `the agreements' ruling, in words` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher put off, in January 2010`
#ASSERT (map (GIVEN x YIELD x's `answer`) (`the agreements' claims on` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher put off, in January 2010`)
    EQUALS LIST 515, 309)
#ASSERT (`the agreements' ruling, in words` `the 2008 public-sector supplement` `a State teacher put off, in January 2010`
    EQUALS CONCAT "309 | ", `the agreement of 17.6.2009`'s `module`, " | ", `§19: the amendment in force changed the earlier provision`)
